	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["24174700F7FB771C"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>四件全有，否则全无</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>面具、长袍、裤子和靴子。部分装备只能抵御部分辐射，换句话说就是毫无防护作用。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每件物品都是羊毛、皮革和铅，所以比起它能节省的东西来说，这很便宜。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 牛奶会取消你已服用的剂量。而套装会阻止你服用任何剂量。"
			]
			id: "36B1995B495AA674"
			rewards: [{
				id: "6D8B557D90A02403"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.35d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#8FE33F to=#8FE33F>全部都要，或者一个也不要</grad>"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "14BF9ADCB8F43ADC"
					item: "mekanism:hazmat_mask"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "0B06DCC5BA15895E"
					item: "mekanism:hazmat_gown"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "1F43C3AE8239B716"
