				item: "mekanism:radioactive_waste_barrel"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.6>废料桶</grad></shadow>"
			x: 3.0d
			y: 7.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3FFF9018DA2A2763"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>从废料到颗粒</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"在 Isotopic Centrifuge 中用 <c1>10</c1> 个 <c2>nuclear waste</c2> 可以合成 <c3>1</c3> 个 <c4>plutonium</c4>。"
				""
				"在加压反应堆中，将1000 plutonium、水和尘埃混合，可获得一个燃料棒，并返还1000 spent nuclear waste。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>钚丸是将废料再加工成燃料的原料。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "2E9FC7DC2AC6FD8E"
			rewards: [{
				id: "353657D187263DAA"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 100
			}]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.35d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#8FE33F to=#8FE33F>废弃，但被纺成线了</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6B40312EE7C8875D"
				item: "mekanism:pellet_plutonium"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.6>钚燃料棒</grad></shadow>"
			x: 3.0d
			y: 9.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3FFF9018DA2A2763"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>从废料到颗粒，反向而行</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"通过太阳能中子活化器将核废料激活可得到1个钋，且该机器必须在露天环境下放置。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>与钚相同的反应室步骤，每颗燃料棒产生相同的 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>1000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>波洛尼ウム是最重要的。MekaSuit系列和整个反物质链都靠它运行。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "1FAAF8216CDC3AC6"
			rewards: [{
				id: "316FC7C98CC22E11"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 100
			}]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.15d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FF6ECF>荒凉，却沐浴着阳光</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "38A344B697C93B3B"
				item: "mekanism:pellet_polonium"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.6>钋丸</grad></shadow>"
			x: 1.15d
			y: 7.475d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1FAAF8216CDC3AC6"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>SPS</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个空的 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>5x5x5</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>最小尺寸的 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>SPS外壳</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，外部端口连接着 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>超充线圈</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>为其供电。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它消耗钋并产出反物质，是整个模组里运行成本最高的设备。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>汇率</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>1000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 钋 变成了 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>1</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 反物质。 </grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每处理一单位钋需要消耗 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>1,000,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>所以一个反物质需要十亿能量和一千个钋。这就是裂变反应堆存在的原因。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 结构玻璃在这里可以用作墙壁，观看SPS运行绝对是该模组最棒的景象之一。"
			]
