			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>最后的电源</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个中空的 </grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>5x5x5</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 框架，即 </grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>Fusion Reactor Frame</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，带有 </grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>Controller</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>Focus Matrix</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，以及用于燃料、水和蒸汽的 </grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>Reactor Ports</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>填满一个空腔，放入控制器，发射激光，它就会亮起来。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>点燃之后</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它能燃烧D-T燃料并产生高温。如何利用这股热量，全由你决定。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>热电偶</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将逃逸的箱内热量直接转化为能量的比例是 </grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>5%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>水冷系统</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将</grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>30%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的机壳热量转化为蒸汽，涡轮机产生的能量远超热电偶所能提供的。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它能独立储存 </grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>1,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 燃料，并缓冲 </grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>1,000,000,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 聚变永不枯竭。氘来自水，氚来自锂，这两种资源都几乎是无限的。"
			]
