		{
			dependencies: ["028276414303BEA2"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>建造塔楼</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个中空的 </grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>Turbine Casing</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，最小尺寸为 </grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>5x5x5</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，中间有一个从地板延伸至接近顶部的转子。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>蒸汽从底部进入，驱动叶片旋转，冷凝后以水排出。它越高越宽，产量就越多。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>各个部分</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>涡轮转子</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>堆叠在中心。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>涡轮叶片</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>位于转子上，每圈四个。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>旋转复合体</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 刀刃停止之处。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"4. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>电磁线圈</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>接触该装置。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"5. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>压力分散器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>填充建筑群下方的土层。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"6. 上部墙壁上的 <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>Turbine Vents</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，以及建筑群上方的 </grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>Saturating Condensers</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。"
				""
				"[!info] 蒸汽腔的每个方块储存 {64,000} 蒸汽，并为涡轮机的能量缓冲器增加 {16,000,000}。"
			]
