				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每个 </grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>压力扩散器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>都会将 </grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>1,280</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的力在一刻内向上推入刀片中。</grad></shadow>"
