				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个由 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>感应外壳</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>组成的空心箱，最小尺寸为 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>3x3x3，内部填充有 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>感应单元</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>感应提供者，并在墙壁上设有 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>感应端口。</grad></shadow>"
