		{
			dependencies: ["3B81800EE6E77EF2"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>它的形状</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>裂变反应堆是一个由</grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>裂变反应堆外壳</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>组成的空心矩形，尺寸从</grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>3x4x3</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>到</grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>18x18x18</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>不等。反应堆玻璃算作一面墙，你需要一些以便能看清内部情况。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>内部，</grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>燃料组件</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>从地板向上堆叠成列，每列顶部都装有</grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>控制棒组件</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>所需的四样东西</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>裂变燃料</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 放入。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>冷却剂</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 注入。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>加热冷却液</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 已排出。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"4. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>核废料</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 已清除。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>墙上每个都是 </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>裂变反应堆端口</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，用配置器设为输入或输出。四个端口是舒适的最低限度。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 在加入任何燃料之前，请先建造好整个装置。无法排出废料的反应堆会损坏自身，而损坏的反应堆正是你失去基地的原因。"
			]
			icon: "mekanismgenerators:fission_reactor_casing"
			id: "1BF3A5C3BDE6371E"
			min_width: 350
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 8
					id: "46484A2BAA9AFBD1"
					item: "mekanismgenerators:fission_reactor_casing"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
