				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.6>建造反应堆</grad></shadow>"
			x: 5.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0696B725E840B996"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>自动关机</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>像端口一样嵌入墙壁，并在你选择的条件下发出红石信号。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>激活</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 红石可以开启和关闭反应堆。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>温度</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>过热时会起火。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- 当命名事件发生时，<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>Damaged</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>Excess Waste</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>Depleted</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 各会燃烧一次。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>电线损坏导致停机，而你有一个在你睡觉时会自我保存的核反应堆。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 搭配工业警报器使用，这样你也能及时发现。"
			]
			icon: "mekanismgenerators:fission_reactor_logic_adapter"
			id: "5D6C9BC7A836B7E8"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "04799965EE020AE7"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 20
			}]
			shape: "circle"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#8FE33F to=#8FE33F>它会自己说明一切</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "032C5FBE8F9EECEA"
				item: "mekanismgenerators:fission_reactor_logic_adapter"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.6>逻辑适配器</grad></shadow>"
			x: 8.5d
			y: 5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3F5010269469EBE0"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>燃烧速率是唯一调节项</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每燃烧1mB裂变燃料会释放</grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>1,000,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>热量。燃烧速率是指每刻消耗多少mB，初始值为</grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>0.1</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你建造的每个燃料组件都会将最大燃烧速率提高 </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>1</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。因此，拥有十个组件的反应堆可以推高至每秒十次，即每秒一千万热量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>冷却才是真正的问题</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>热量必须尽快排出，否则反应堆会开始受损。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>水</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>冷却剂是免费且较弱的。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>钠</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的单位热容量更高，并以锅炉可用的过热钠的形式返回。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>沸腾效率取决于燃料组件的表面面积。目标是每个组件有 </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>4</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 个方块表面积，所以分散组件比堆叠在一起更好。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 每次只提高一点燃烧率，并在下一步之前等待温度稳定。本章所有问题都出在这里。"
			]
			icon: "mekanismgenerators:control_rod_assembly"
