		{
			dependencies: ["71DB87166603A239"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>失败案例</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Past </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>100</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> percent damage the reactor rolls a small chance every tick to melt down, and that chance climbs as the damage does.</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"熔毁是 <c1>8</c1> 倍于普通爆炸的连锁反应，会使内部所有物品的放射性增加 <c2>50</c2> 倍。反应堆随后会重置到 <c3>75</c3> 的损坏程度，因此该区域之后仍然危险。"
				""
				"[!danger] 当反应堆温度超过冷却能力，或废料输出堵塞时，伤害会上升。两者均可避免，且后果严重。"
			]
