		{
			dependencies: ["71DB87166603A239"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>它会跟随着你回家</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>泄漏的废料、破损的桶或熔毁会在世界中留下辐射，站在其中会给你造成持续存在的辐射剂量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>盖革计数器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会读取你所在位置辐射的数值。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>剂量计</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>显示你个人吸收了多少辐射量。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一套完整的 </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>防护服</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>能防止它接触到你。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>源和自身的剂量都会自行衰减，但严重的泄漏需要数小时才能消退。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 喝牛奶可以立即清除你的剂量。在反应堆房间放一桶牛奶。"
			]
