		{
			dependencies: ["2E9FC7DC2AC6FD8E"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>循环闭合</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个钚丸加上 </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>1个氯化氢</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 会生成 </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>4个</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>裂变碎片。氧化一个碎片，你就能得到 </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.8>2000个</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>裂变燃料。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>也就是说，一个燃料棒就能产出八千单位的燃料，而这些燃料棒是用反应堆本身产生的废料制成的。一旦这个循环开始运行，反应堆就能自我供能了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"再处理会产生乏核废料，它在桶中不会衰变。将其投入 Evolved Mekanism 的转换机，而不是囤积起来。"
			]
			icon: "mekanism:reprocessed_fissile_fragment"
			id: "6BEDDD356FF51508"
			optional: true
			rewards: [
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
					id: "4D1990CF13D1689E"
					table_id: 3488080005486828330L
					type: "random"
				}
				{
					id: "720D8CE095E82E00"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 40
				}
			]
			shape: "circle"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#8FE33F to=#8FE33F>循环闭合了</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1E8D0C9240A044A9"
				item: "mekanism:reprocessed_fissile_fragment"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8FE33F to=#DCFFA8 f=0.6>再加工</grad></shadow>"
			x: 1.0d
			y: 9.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["71DB87166603A239"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>为什么不直接用水呢</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>水可以冷却反应堆并转化为可用的蒸汽，对于小型反应堆来说已经足够了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>钠</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的单位热容量要高得多，这意味着用钠冷却的反应器可以在不损坏的情况下以更高的燃烧率运行。它会以</grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.8>过热钠</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的形式返回，在建造锅炉之前并无直接用途。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>钠来自盐的氧化，而盐则来自充满卤水的蒸发塔。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 将回路建成闭环。超热钠进入锅炉，锅炉返还冷钠，没有任何消耗。"
			]
			icon: "mekanism:sodium_bucket"
			id: "35EF76F0B951BFA8"
			rewards: [{
				id: "23E9BA6396030791"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 25
			}]
			shape: "pentagon"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FF8A4C>盐，不过是熔化的盐</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
