		{
			dependencies: ["244269497F76692E"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFD4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>管道安装</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>阀门是唯一进出通道。需要进水、出蒸汽、进超热钠、出冷却钠。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每个阀门都由 Configurator 设置，且一个阀门一次只能执行一项任务。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "mekanism:boiler_valve"
			id: "44C667C5803DFAF0"
